<title>USA: Mobile passes $60 mln bonds for bridges and drains.</title>
<headline>Mobile passes $60 mln bonds for bridges and drains.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE, Ala. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Mobile County, Alabama approved $60 million of special tax bonds for bridges and drainage, an official in the election office in the county probate court said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The voters approved it by 71 percent with 54,227 voting yes and 21,683 voting no on the measure in unofficial results, the election official said.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
